OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFriday will start wet with some
OL,6,Fheavy rain around, coupled with breezy
OL,7,Fconditions at times. Skies will
OL,8,Fbrighten from the northwest through
OL,9,Fthe morning, leaving a fine afternoon
OL,10,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. Staying
OL,11,Fbreezy, and feeling fresher than
OL,12,Frecently.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThe odd shower may affect the
OL,15,FPeak District overnight, but most
OL,16,Fplaces will be dry and there will be
OL,17,Fclear periods. Winds easing, and
OL,18,Fturning chilly in some rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,169,160,301,260,100,100
