OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny early showers should
OL,6,Ffade on Saturday morning to leave
OL,7,Fplenty of dry and bright weather with
OL,8,Fgentle winds. Some cloud arriving from
OL,9,Fthe west later though, and staying
OL,10,Ffresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,13,Fwarm sunshine on Sunday, although
OL,14,Fturning windy. Rain overnight, then
OL,15,Fsunshine on Monday. Further wet and
OL,16,Fwindy weather arriving later, followed
OL,17,Fby sunshine and some blustery showers
OL,18,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
